  "description": "<p>Introduce a unique touch of the outdoors to your home with this distinctive area rug, featuring a detailed Bigfoot design. This rug serves as a perfect accent for spaces seeking a rustic charm and a hint of adventure. Its comfortable feel and practical features make it an ideal addition to various indoor settings.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features a unique and detailed Sasquatch design</li>\n<li>Adds rustic charm suitable for nature and wildlife enthusiasts</li>\n<li>Provides comfort underfoot with a soft surface</li>\n<li>Equipped with non-slip backing for enhanced safety</li>\n<li>Designed for ease of cleaning and low maintenance</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Area Rug</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Machine-Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Indoor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Living Room, Bedroom, Cabin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Non-slip backing</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bigfoot</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Outdoor Adventure, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>High-quality Epoxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft surface</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Regular vacuuming or gentle washing</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This area rug is well-suited for adding personality to indoor spaces such as living rooms, bedrooms, or cabins. Its rustic theme makes it a great fit for homes that appreciate nature-inspired decor and comfort.</p>",
